{"title":"새벽의 연화 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=fc1aU/dJMcagF1YJZ/b90PvG6kgttkykaLOKGmgK&filename=th3","synopsis":"정돈되지 않는 붉은 머리칼을 마음에 들어 하지 않는 고화왕국의 공주인 연화는 외동딸로,\n다정한 부왕과 소꿉친구이자 호위인 하쿠에게 둘러싸여 소중히 자라고 있었다.\n연화의 16살생일. 연화는 좋아하던 사촌 수원에게 머리장식을 선물 받으며 ‘새벽하늘의 머리색을 닮았다’는 말을 듣고 가슴 설렌다.\n수원을 향한 마음을 아버지에게 알리러 가지만 그곳에는 생각지도 못한 가혹한 운명이?!\n\nAKATSUKI NO YONA ⓒ MIZUHO KUSANAGI 2010 / HAKUSENSHA, INC., Tokyo","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":282,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":241,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":96}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":90,"change":{"type":"up","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":116}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":78}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":250,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":214,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":104,"change":{"type":"up","amount":110}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":278,"change":{"type":"down","amount":174}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":265,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":123}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":150}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":208,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":254,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":215,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":77}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":188,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":160,"ch